    <sys:String x:Key="About_GuideTitle">Wallpaper Usage Guide</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="About_CrudCreateTitle">1. Adding New Wallpapers</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="About_CrudCreateDesc">Click the "+ Add Wallpaper" button on the Home page. Choose any supported video file (.mp4, .webm, .mkv, .avi, .mov). Livy will automatically store the video into the local library and generate a thumbnail preview instantly.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="About_CrudReadTitle">2. Browsing &amp; Previewing Library</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="About_CrudReadDesc">Explore your entire wallpaper library on the Home gallery complete with resolution and duration details. Click a thumbnail or the "Preview" button to inspect the video in full screen before applying it to your desktop.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="About_CrudUpdateTitle">3. Customizing Info &amp; Loop Modes</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="About_CrudUpdateDesc">Right-click any wallpaper card and select "Edit" to modify its title or playback loop mode. Choose between Normal, Seamless Ping-Pong (smooth forward-reverse loop), or Crossfade to match your visual taste.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="About_CrudDeleteTitle">4. Removing Wallpapers</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="About_CrudDeleteDesc">Hover over a wallpaper card and click the red trash can icon at the top-left of the thumbnail, or right-click the card and choose "Delete". Confirm the dialog prompt to remove the wallpaper from your library.</sys:String>
